---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility Statement - JKSPDC"
  description="Accessibility Statement for the official JKSPDC website. WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance status, known limitations, and contact for accessibility support."
>
  <div class="space-y-0">
    <!-- Page Header Band -->
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="current">Accessibility Statement</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 prose-gov space-y-6">

        <!-- Conformance Status -->
        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Conformance Status</h2>
          <p>
            Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL) is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for all people, including persons with disabilities. We are continually improving the user experience for everyone and applying relevant accessibility standards.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This website conforms to the <strong>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA</strong> as incorporated in the <strong>Guidelines for Indian Government Websites and Apps (GIGW) 3.0</strong> issued by the Government of India.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">
              ℹ️ Conformance Status: <strong>Substantially Conforms</strong> — The website substantially meets WCAG 2.1 Level AA. Some content may not fully conform as noted in the Known Limitations section below.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Accessibility Features -->
        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Accessibility Features</h2>
          <p>This website includes the following accessibility features:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
            <li>✅ <strong>Skip to Main Content</strong> — Keyboard users can skip navigation and jump directly to page content</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Keyboard Navigation</strong> — All interactive elements are accessible using only a keyboard</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Visible Focus Indicators</strong> — Keyboard focus is clearly visible on all interactive elements</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Font Size Controls</strong> — Text can be increased or decreased using the accessibility bar</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>High Contrast Mode</strong> — A high contrast display mode is available</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Language Selection</strong> — Content available in English, Hindi, Urdu, Kashmiri, and Dogri</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Semantic HTML</strong> — Proper heading structure, landmarks, and semantic markup used throughout</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Breadcrumb Navigation</strong> — Clear location indicators on all pages</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Descriptive Link Text</strong> — Links are descriptive of their destination</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Alternative Text</strong> — Images include descriptive alternative text</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Responsive Design</strong> — Website works on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Screen Reader Compatible</strong> — Tested for basic compatibility with screen reading software</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Reduced Motion</strong> — Animations are disabled when the user's OS accessibility settings prefer reduced motion</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>External Link Indicators</strong> — External links are labelled for screen readers</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Known Limitations -->
        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Known Limitations</h2>
          <p>Despite our efforts, some content may not fully conform to WCAG 2.1 Level AA:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <strong>Legacy PDF Documents:</strong> Some older PDF documents uploaded to this website may be scanned image-only PDFs without searchable text. These are being progressively remediated. Until remediation is complete, users may request alternative formats by contacting us.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Third-Party Content:</strong> Embedded content from third-party websites (such as the JK Tenders Portal) may not meet the same accessibility standards. We have no control over the accessibility of third-party websites.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Translation Accuracy:</strong> Machine-translated content (via Bhashini) may not perfectly convey all nuances. The English version is the official version.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Specification -->
        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Technical Specification</h2>
          <p>Accessibility of this website relies on the following technologies working in combination:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• HTML5 (semantic markup)</li>
            <li>• CSS (including ARIA landmark roles)</li>
            <li>• WAI-ARIA (where necessary)</li>
            <li>• JavaScript (progressive enhancement only)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm">These technologies are relied upon for conformance with WCAG 2.1 Level AA.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feedback & Contact -->
        <div class="card-static" id="feedback">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Feedback &amp; Contact for Accessibility Issues</h2>
          <p>
            We welcome your feedback on the accessibility of this website. If you experience barriers or have suggestions for improvement, please contact us:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <p><strong>Web Information Manager:</strong> [WIM TO BE FORMALLY NOMINATED BY JKSPDC]</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">md-jkspdcl[at]jk[dot]gov[dot]in</a></p>
            <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 194 2451665 (Srinagar) / +91 191 2430548 (Jammu)</p>
            <p><strong>Online Feedback:</strong> <a href="/feedback" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">Submit Feedback Form</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded text-xs text-yellow-800">
            <strong>Response Time:</strong> We aim to respond to accessibility feedback within 5 working days.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Enforcement -->
        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Enforcement Procedure</h2>
          <p class="text-sm">
            The GIGW 3.0 guidelines are issued under the authority of the Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology (MeitY), Government of India. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may escalate the matter to:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 text-sm space-y-1">
            <p><strong>Department of Electronics and Information Technology (MeitY)</strong></p>
            <p>Electronics Niketan, 6 CGO Complex, New Delhi — 110003</p>
            <p>Website: <a href="https://www.meity.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">www.meity.gov.in<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Statement Dates -->
        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Assessment &amp; Review Dates</h2>
          <div class="text-sm space-y-1">
            <p><strong>Statement Created:</strong> August 2026</p>
            <p><strong>Last Reviewed:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' })}</p>
            <p><strong>Next Scheduled Review:</strong> August 2027</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">This statement was prepared following a self-assessment by the JKSPDC IT Cell. An independent audit by a STQC/NIC empanelled agency is recommended.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="space-y-5">
        <div class="card-static">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card-title">Related</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">
            <li><a href="/feedback" class="sidebar-link">Submit Feedback</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about-us/others/contact" class="sidebar-link">Contact Us</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help" class="sidebar-link">Help &amp; FAQ</a></li>
            <li><a href="/terms-conditions" class="sidebar-link">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="sidebar-link">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">GIGW 3.0 Reference</p>
          <p>This accessibility statement complies with GIGW 3.0 Section B (Accessibility) requirements and references WCAG 2.1 Level AA conformance.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
